        <div class="lib-card"><h3><i class="fas fa-chart-pie"></i> Circle-progress.fscss</h3><p>Animated circular progress indicators, perfect for dashboards and KPI displays.</p><a class="lib-link" href="https://github.com/Figsh/Circle-progress.fscss" target="_blank">github.com/Figsh/Circle-progress.fscss <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt"></i></a></div>
